  "name": "Warcraft Reborn Prestige works like Conquest of Azeroth's and also resets the active talent spec and Mystic Enchant preset",
  "contract": [
    "Issue 8326: Chromie refused stock classes on Warcraft Reborn (Prestige Mode is only available to Conquest of Azeroth classes).",
    "A Reborn character at the Prestige level activates Prestige like a CoA class: level 1, 0 experience, the Prestige aura, the rewards, the quest reset and the racial start.",
    "The active talent spec's talents are reset, every Mystic Enchant in the active preset is removed, class spells above level 1 are forgotten and a lower rank becomes usable again.",
    "The specialization is the talent spec: activating the other talent spec is refused until the Prestige level, then allowed."
  ],
